                    <div class="rank-fill" style="width:53%"></div>
                  </div><span class="rank-val">980km</span><span class="chev">›</span>
                </a>
                <a class="rank-row" href="#" data-veh="PRKP58" title="Ver reporte de PRKP58 (runReport)"><span
