                  <div class="rank-track">
                    <div class="rank-fill" style="width:11%"></div>
                  </div><span class="rank-val">210km</span><span class="chev">›</span>
                </a>
                <div class="km-color-legend"><span class="km-legend-grad"></span>Oscuro = más km &middot; Claro = menos
